All tests pass. Here's a summary of the changes:

**`go/ast/inspector/inspector.go`** — added `Len() int` method:

```go
// Len returns the number of AST nodes the inspector holds,
// the same count that ast.Inspect visits over the files given to New.
func (in *Inspector) Len() int {
	n := 0
	for i := int32(0); i < int32(len(in.events)); i++ {
		if in.events[i].index > i {
			n++
		}
	}
	return n
}
```

It counts push events (where `index > i`), which correspond one-to-one with AST nodes visited by `ast.Inspect`.

**`go/ast/inspector/inspector_test.go`** — added `TestLen` that verifies `Len()` equals the `ast.Inspect` node count on a sample file.

